  "title": "Supermarket Pasta Salad Recall: Listeria Warning Issued for ASDA and Morrisons Products",
  "summary": "A food safety warning has been issued over three ready-to-eat pasta products sold in major UK supermarkets after a possible contamination with Listeria monocytogenes was identified. Consumers are being advised not to eat the affected products and to return them for a full refund. Shoppers in England, Scotland and Wales are being urged to check their refrigerators after food producer Greencore announced a recall involving pasta salad products sold through ASDA and Morrisons. The recall relates",
